WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.932
Day 8. The Partners of Ten.

2
00:00:02.382 --> 00:00:10.382
Watch first. Show it with real things. The first one on the page is done for you. Then do one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.882 --> 00:00:16.292
Fill the ten frame mat with real things of two kinds. Seven of one, three of the other.

4
00:00:16.742 --> 00:00:20.297
Say: seven and three make ten. Three is the partner of seven.

5
00:00:20.897 --> 00:00:24.064
Change it to six and four. Your child says the partner.

6
00:00:24.664 --> 00:00:29.395
The partners of ten are worth knowing by heart. They make adding much easier later.

7
00:00:29.995 --> 00:00:34.776
On the page, your child counts the apples, counts the stars, and writes the partner.
